---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Classic BMW & Porsche Repair, Specs, and Buyer's Guides
description: "Known problems, real repair costs, torque specs, parts sources, and buyer's guides for classic BMWs and Porsches, from the E28 and 924 to the E90 and 991."
extraScripts:
  - js/newsletter.js
  - js/home.js
---
{%- set ticket = home.ticket -%}
{%- set featured = home.featured -%}

<div class="hm">

<!-- 00 · Hero -->
<section class="hm-hero" aria-labelledby="hm-title">
    <div class="hm-hero-copy">
        <p class="hm-kicker">Field notes · {{ stats.vehicles }} BMWs &amp; Porsches · E28 to 991</p>
        <h1 id="hm-title" class="hm-title">Old BMWs and Porsches, <span>kept on the road.</span></h1>
        <p class="hm-lede">What breaks, what it costs to fix, the torque spec, and where to buy the part. Written for anyone with a floor jack and a free Saturday.</p>

        <form class="hm-search" action="/search/" method="get" role="search" data-home-search>
            <label class="hm-search-field hm-search-car">
                <span class="hm-search-label">Car</span>
                <select name="car" data-car-select>
                    <option value="">Any car</option>
                    {% for brandKey, list in home.cars %}
                    <optgroup label="{{ 'BMW' if brandKey == 'bmw' else 'Porsche' }}">
                        {% for car in list %}<option value="{{ car.key }}" data-url="{{ car.url }}">{{ car.model }} · {{ car.series }}</option>{% endfor %}
                    </optgroup>
                    {% endfor %}
                </select>
            </label>
            <label class="hm-search-field hm-search-query">
                <span class="hm-search-label">What's going on?</span>
                <input type="search" name="q" placeholder="VANOS, IMS bearing, subframe…" autocomplete="off">
            </label>
            <button type="submit" class="hm-search-btn">Search</button>
        </form>

        <p class="hm-resume hm-garage-status" hidden data-garage-status>
            <span data-garage-text></span>
            <a href="/account/garage/" data-garage-link>My Garage <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </p>

        <p class="hm-resume" hidden data-resume>
            <span>Pick up where you left off:</span>
            <a href="/resources/" data-resume-link>your car <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </p>

        <p class="hm-chips">
            <span>Common searches</span>
            <a href="/search/?q=vanos">VANOS</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=ims+bearing">IMS bearing</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=cooling">Cooling system</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=timing+belt">Timing belt</a>
        </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="hm-figure">
        <div class="hm-blueprint">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 600 420" role="img" aria-labelledby="hm-fig-title">
                <title id="hm-fig-title">Line drawing of an early long-hood Porsche 911, marking where these cars usually need work: suspension bushings and mounts, the engine's belts, chains and seals, and rust in the sills.</title>
                <defs>
                    <pattern id="bp-grid-sm" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M20 0H0V20" fill="none" class="bp-grid-line"/></pattern>
                    <pattern id="bp-grid" width="100" height="100" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><rect width="100" height="100" fill="url(#bp-grid-sm)"/><path d="M100 0H0V100" fill="none" class="bp-grid-line bp-grid-major"/></pattern>
                    <marker id="bp-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="5" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 1 9 5 0 9z" class="bp-fill"/></marker>
                </defs>
                <rect width="600" height="420" fill="url(#bp-grid)"/>

                <!-- The car: the logo's long-hood 911, drawn as a line -->
                <g transform="translate(40 150) scale(6.5)" class="bp-car">
                    <path vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" d="M3.28 20.71C2.27 19.98 2 17.97 2.27 16.51C2.73 14.5 4.01 12.58 5.83 11.49C7.48 10.66 9.85 10.57 12.41 10.81C18.43 11.12 24.82 10.48 30.48 9.3C33.4 6.65 35.77 4.09 38.33 2.72C40.7 1.63 44.54 1.54 47.64 2.27C55.86 4.09 64.07 7.01 70.46 9.57C74.29 11.12 76.85 12.67 77.58 14.5C78.04 15.78 77.95 17.42 77.58 18.15C77.12 19.61 76.3 20.52 74.84 20.8L65.57 21.89A6.79 6.79 0 1 0 52.27 21.89L24.17 21.89A6.79 6.79 0 1 0 10.87 21.89L4.92 21.53C4.01 21.34 3.55 21.03 3.28 20.71Z"/>
                    <path vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" d="M32.4 8.75C34.68 6.47 36.5 4.55 38.69 3.45C40.7 2.63 43.99 2.54 45.81 2.81L45.91 8.66ZM47.18 3C52.39 4 56.4 5.74 59.51 7.38C60.15 7.74 59.87 8.2 58.96 8.2L47.18 8.57Z"/>
                    <path vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="bp-thin" d="M26.83 21.62C26.65 16.87 26.83 12.31 28.47 9.75M46.54 21.62L46.54 8.66M30.48 9.3C42.16 9.11 54.94 8.47 60.42 8.02M41.98 11.03L44.72 11.03M2.55 16.87C5.65 16.6 8.94 16.51 10.58 16.51M71.01 16.6C74.11 16.65 76.48 16.78 77.95 16.87M6.75 15.23C5.38 14.32 5.29 12.49 6.56 11.49M61.33 7.93C65.9 8.47 70.28 9.93 74.11 11.76"/>
                    <circle vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" cx="17.52" cy="20.52" r="5.48"/>
                    <circle vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" cx="58.92" cy="20.52" r="5.48"/>
                    <circle vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="bp-thin" cx="17.52" cy="20.52" r="3.74"/>
                    <circle vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="bp-thin" cx="58.92" cy="20.52" r="3.74"/>
                    <path vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="bp-thin" d="M17.52 19.24L17.52 16.87M18.74 20.13L20.99 19.39M18.27 21.55L19.67 23.47M16.77 21.55L15.37 23.47M16.3 20.13L14.05 19.39M58.92 19.24L58.92 16.87M60.14 20.13L62.39 19.39M59.67 21.55L61.07 23.47M58.17 21.55L56.77 23.47M57.7 20.13L55.45 19.39"/>
                </g>

                <!-- Ground and wheelbase -->
                <path d="M20 319H580" class="bp-line bp-thin"/>
                <path d="M153.9 300v44M423 300v44" class="bp-line bp-thin bp-dash"/>
                <path d="M160 338H417" class="bp-line" marker-start="url(#bp-arrow)" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)"/>
                <text x="288.5" y="332" text-anchor="middle" class="bp-text bp-small">WHEELBASE</text>

                <!-- Callouts -->
                <g class="bp-callout">
                    <path d="M118 88 154 239" class="bp-line"/>
                    <circle cx="154" cy="241" r="4" class="bp-fill"/>
                    <circle cx="36" cy="76" r="12" class="bp-badge"/>
                    <text x="36" y="80.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bp-text bp-num">01</text>
                    <text x="56" y="81" class="bp-text">BUSHINGS &amp; MOUNTS</text>
                </g>
                <g class="bp-callout">
                    <path d="M486 88V226" class="bp-line"/>
                    <circle cx="486" cy="228" r="4" class="bp-fill"/>
                    <circle cx="352" cy="76" r="12" class="bp-badge"/>
                    <text x="352" y="80.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bp-text bp-num">02</text>
                    <text x="372" y="81" class="bp-text">BELTS, CHAINS, SEALS</text>
                </g>
                <g class="bp-callout">
                    <path d="M288 294V392H218" class="bp-line"/>
                    <circle cx="288" cy="292" r="4" class="bp-fill"/>
                    <circle cx="36" cy="392" r="12" class="bp-badge"/>
                    <text x="36" y="396.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bp-text bp-num">03</text>
                    <text x="56" y="397" class="bp-text">RUST IN THE SILLS</text>
                </g>

                <!-- Title block -->
                <text x="580" y="30" text-anchor="end" class="bp-text bp-small">FIG. 1 · WHERE THEY USUALLY GO</text>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <a class="hm-ticket" href="{{ ticket.url }}">
            <span class="hm-ticket-top">
                <span class="hm-ticket-code">{{ ticket.car.model }} · Known issue</span>
                <span class="hm-badge">{{ ticket.issue.difficulty }}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="hm-ticket-title">{{ ticket.issue.title }}</span>
            <span class="hm-ticket-costs">
                <span><span class="hm-cost-label">DIY</span> {{ ticket.issue.repairCosts.diy | money }}</span>
                <span><span class="hm-cost-label">Shop</span> {{ ticket.issue.repairCosts.shop | money }}</span>
            </span>
        </a>
        <figcaption class="visually-hidden">Example: {{ ticket.car.model }} {{ ticket.issue.title }}.</figcaption>
    </figure>
</section>

<!-- Stats -->
<section class="hm-stats" aria-label="What's on the site">
    <dl>
        <div><dt>cars covered</dt><dd>{{ stats.vehicles }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>known issues</dt><dd>{{ stats.issues }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>guides</dt><dd>{{ stats.guides }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>torque specs</dt><dd>{{ stats.torqueSpecs }}</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<!-- 01 · The cars -->
<section class="hm-section hm-index" id="vehicles" aria-labelledby="hm-cars-title">
    <div class="hm-head">
        <div>
            <p class="hm-eyebrow"><span>01</span> The cars</p>
            <h2 id="hm-cars-title">Pick your chassis.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Every car gets the same treatment: known problems with repair costs, guides, torque specs, parts sources, and a buyer's guide.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hm-brand-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Brand" hidden data-brand-tabs>
        <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-bmw" aria-controls="list-bmw" aria-selected="true">BMW <span>{{ home.cars.bmw.length }}</span></button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-porsche" aria-controls="list-porsche" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Porsche <span>{{ home.cars.porsche.length }}</span></button>
    </div>

    <div class="hm-index-grid">
        {% for brandKey, list in home.cars %}
        {% set brandName = 'BMW' if brandKey == 'bmw' else 'Porsche' %}
        <div class="hm-index-col" id="list-{{ brandKey }}" data-brand-panel="{{ brandKey }}" aria-labelledby="hm-col-{{ brandKey }}">
            <div class="hm-index-head">
                <h3 id="hm-col-{{ brandKey }}">{{ brandName }}</h3>
                <a href="/resources/{{ brandKey }}/">All {{ list.length }} {{ brandName }}s <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </div>
            <ul class="hm-index-list">
                {% for car in list %}
                <li>
                    <a href="{{ car.url }}" class="hm-index-row">
                        <span class="hm-index-code">{{ car.model }}</span>
                        <span class="hm-index-series">{{ car.series }}</span>
                        <span class="hm-index-years">{{ car.years | range }}</span>
                        <span class="hm-index-count">{{ car.issues }} issues</span>
                        <svg class="hm-index-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
                    </a>
                </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>

<!-- 02 · Inside a car page -->
<section class="hm-inside" aria-labelledby="hm-inside-title">
    <div class="hm-inside-inner">
        <div class="hm-inside-copy">
            <p class="hm-eyebrow"><span>02</span> Inside a car page</p>
            <h2 id="hm-inside-title">The whole job, not just the symptom.</h2>
            <p>Each known issue comes with what it costs at home and at a shop, the part numbers, and where the information came from.</p>
            <ul class="hm-checks">
                <li>DIY and shop price ranges</li>
                <li>OEM part numbers</li>
                <li>Sources you can check</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="hm-btn hm-btn-ink" href="{{ featured.car.url }}">Open the {{ featured.car.model }} page <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>

        <article class="hm-issue" aria-label="Example issue from the {{ featured.car.model }} page">
            <div class="hm-issue-body">
                <p class="hm-issue-meta">
                    <span>{{ featured.car.brandName }} {{ featured.car.model }} · {{ featured.car.years | range }}</span>
                    <span class="hm-badge">{{ featured.issue.difficulty }}</span>
                </p>
                <h3><a href="{{ featured.url }}">{{ featured.issue.title }}</a></h3>
                <p>{{ featured.issue.description }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hm-issue-costs">
                <div>
                    <span class="hm-cost-label">Do it yourself</span>
                    <span class="hm-issue-cost">{{ featured.issue.repairCosts.diy | money }}</span>
                    <span class="hm-meter"><span style="width: {{ featured.diyBar.left + featured.diyBar.width }}%"></span></span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="hm-cost-label">At a shop</span>
                    <span class="hm-issue-cost">{{ featured.issue.repairCosts.shop | money }}</span>
                    <span class="hm-meter hm-meter-shop"><span style="width: {{ featured.shopBar.left + featured.shopBar.width }}%"></span></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% if featured.issue.parts and featured.issue.parts.length %}
            <div class="hm-issue-parts">
                <h4 class="hm-cost-label">Parts</h4>
                <table>
                    <thead class="visually-hidden"><tr><th>Part</th><th>Part number</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                    {% for part in featured.issue.parts %}
                    <tr><td>{{ part.name }}</td><td class="hm-mono hm-muted">{{ (part.partNumber | partNumber(featured.car.brand)) if part.partNumber else (part.brand or '') }}</td><td class="hm-mono hm-right">{{ part.price | money }}</td></tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                {% if featured.issue.sources and featured.issue.sources.length %}
                <p class="hm-sources">Sources:
                    {% for src in featured.issue.sources %}<a href="{{ src.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ src.name }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}
                </p>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- 03 · The big jobs -->
<section class="hm-section hm-jobs" aria-labelledby="hm-jobs-title">
    <div class="hm-head">
        <div>
            <p class="hm-eyebrow"><span>03</span> Know before you buy</p>
            <h2 id="hm-jobs-title">The big jobs, priced.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>The failures worth knowing about before you hand over money, on one scale. <span class="hm-legend"><span class="hm-key hm-key-diy"></span>DIY <span class="hm-key hm-key-shop"></span>Shop</span></p>
    </div>

    <ol class="hm-jobs-list">
        {% for job in home.bigJobs %}
        <li>
            <a class="hm-job" href="{{ job.url }}">
                <span class="hm-job-code">{{ job.car.model }}</span>
                <span class="hm-job-main">
                    <span class="hm-job-title">{{ job.issue.title }}</span>
                    <span class="hm-job-car">{{ job.car.brandName }} {{ job.car.series }} · {{ job.car.years | range }}</span>
                </span>
                <span class="hm-job-scale" aria-hidden="true">
                    {% if job.diyBar %}<span class="hm-bar hm-bar-diy" style="left: {{ job.diyBar.left }}%; width: {{ job.diyBar.width }}%"></span>{% endif %}
                    {% if job.shopBar %}<span class="hm-bar hm-bar-shop" style="left: {{ job.shopBar.left }}%; width: {{ job.shopBar.width }}%"></span>{% endif %}
                </span>
                <span class="hm-job-costs">
                    <span><span class="hm-cost-label">DIY</span> {{ job.issue.repairCosts.diy | money }}</span>
                    <span><span class="hm-cost-label">Shop</span> {{ job.issue.repairCosts.shop | money }}</span>
                </span>
            </a>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <div class="hm-ruler-row" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span><span></span>
        <div class="hm-ruler">{% for tick in home.ruler %}<span style="left: {{ tick.pos }}%">{{ tick.label }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
        <span></span>
    </div>
    <p class="hm-jobs-more"><a href="/resources/">All {{ stats.issues }} known issues are on the car pages <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
</section>

<!-- 04 · My Garage -->
<section class="hm-garage" aria-labelledby="hm-garage-title">
    <div class="hm-garage-inner">
        <div class="hm-garage-copy">
            <p class="hm-eyebrow"><span>04</span> My Garage</p>
            <h2 id="hm-garage-title">Your car, and every job you've done to it.</h2>
            <p>Add your car and you get its service schedule with the intervals already filled in, a restoration tracker, and a log of every job. Free, and it syncs between your phone and your laptop.</p>
            <div class="hm-actions">
                <a class="hm-btn hm-btn-accent" href="/account/garage/">Add your car</a>
                <a class="hm-btn hm-btn-ghost" href="/tools/build-calculator/">Build cost calculator</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hm-garage-card" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="hm-garage-card-head">
                <span class="hm-garage-plate">944</span>
                <span class="hm-garage-name">Your 944<span>Service schedule</span></span>
                <span class="hm-garage-example">Example</span>
            </div>
            <ul>
                <li><span class="hm-dot hm-dot-due"></span><span>Timing and balance shaft belts</span><span class="hm-due">Due soon</span></li>
                <li><span class="hm-dot hm-dot-next"></span><span>Water pump</span><span>With the belts</span></li>
                <li><span class="hm-dot"></span><span>Engine oil and filter</span><span>OK</span></li>
                <li><span class="hm-dot"></span><span>Restoration</span><span class="hm-progress"><span style="width: 45%"></span></span></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- 05 · Who writes this -->
<section class="hm-section hm-author" aria-labelledby="hm-author-title">
    <div class="hm-author-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200">
            <defs><path id="stamp-ring" d="M100 100m-74 0a74 74 0 1 1 148 0a74 74 0 1 1-148 0"/></defs>
            <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="96" class="stamp-edge"/>
            <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="58" class="stamp-edge stamp-thin"/>
            <text class="stamp-text"><textPath href="#stamp-ring" textLength="462">ZRG CLASSICS · ZURÜCKGEBEN · PACIFIC NORTHWEST ·</textPath></text>
            <g transform="translate(60 84)">
                <defs><clipPath id="stamp-clip"><path d="M3.28 20.71C2.27 19.98 2 17.97 2.27 16.51C2.73 14.5 4.01 12.58 5.83 11.49C7.48 10.66 9.85 10.57 12.41 10.81C18.43 11.12 24.82 10.48 30.48 9.3C33.4 6.65 35.77 4.09 38.33 2.72C40.7 1.63 44.54 1.54 47.64 2.27C55.86 4.09 64.07 7.01 70.46 9.57C74.29 11.12 76.85 12.67 77.58 14.5C78.04 15.78 77.95 17.42 77.58 18.15C77.12 19.61 76.3 20.52 74.84 20.8L65.57 21.89A6.79 6.79 0 1 0 52.27 21.89L24.17 21.89A6.79 6.79 0 1 0 10.87 21.89L4.92 21.53C4.01 21.34 3.55 21.03 3.28 20.71Z"/></clipPath></defs>
                <path class="logo-body" d="M3.28 20.71C2.27 19.98 2 17.97 2.27 16.51C2.73 14.5 4.01 12.58 5.83 11.49C7.48 10.66 9.85 10.57 12.41 10.81C18.43 11.12 24.82 10.48 30.48 9.3C33.4 6.65 35.77 4.09 38.33 2.72C40.7 1.63 44.54 1.54 47.64 2.27C55.86 4.09 64.07 7.01 70.46 9.57C74.29 11.12 76.85 12.67 77.58 14.5C78.04 15.78 77.95 17.42 77.58 18.15C77.12 19.61 76.3 20.52 74.84 20.8L65.57 21.89A6.79 6.79 0 1 0 52.27 21.89L24.17 21.89A6.79 6.79 0 1 0 10.87 21.89L4.92 21.53C4.01 21.34 3.55 21.03 3.28 20.71Z"/>
                <path class="logo-stripe" clip-path="url(#stamp-clip)" d="M0 14.13h80v1.64H0z"/>
                <path class="logo-glass" d="M32.4 8.75C34.68 6.47 36.5 4.55 38.69 3.45C40.7 2.63 43.99 2.54 45.81 2.81L45.91 8.66ZM47.18 3C52.39 4 56.4 5.74 59.51 7.38C60.15 7.74 59.87 8.2 58.96 8.2L47.18 8.57Z"/>
                <circle class="logo-wheel" cx="17.52" cy="20.52" r="5.5"/>
                <circle class="logo-rim" cx="17.52" cy="20.52" r="3.3"/>
                <circle class="logo-wheel" cx="17.52" cy="20.52" r="1.3"/>
                <circle class="logo-wheel" cx="58.92" cy="20.52" r="5.5"/>
                <circle class="logo-rim" cx="58.92" cy="20.52" r="3.3"/>
                <circle class="logo-wheel" cx="58.92" cy="20.52" r="1.3"/>
            </g>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="hm-author-copy">
        <p class="hm-eyebrow" id="hm-author-title"><span>05</span> Who writes this</p>
        <blockquote>ZRG comes from <em lang="de">zurückgeben</em>: to give back, to restore. A good restoration gives a car back what time and neglect took out of it.</blockquote>
        <p>I'm {{ site.author.name }}, a small independent mechanic in the Pacific Northwest, and these are the cars I work on. If something here is wrong, tell me and I'll fix it.</p>
        <p class="hm-links"><a href="/about/">More about ZRG <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href="/about/#contact">Send a correction <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- 06 · Also here -->
<section class="hm-section hm-more" aria-labelledby="hm-more-title">
    <p class="hm-eyebrow" id="hm-more-title"><span>06</span> Also in the shop</p>
    <div class="hm-more-grid">
        <a class="hm-more-card" href="/forum/">
            <span class="hm-more-icon">{% include "icons/chat.svg" %}</span>
            <span class="hm-more-title">Ask the forum</span>
            <span class="hm-more-text">A board for each car. Post the weird noise, the part you can't identify, or the build you're halfway through.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="hm-more-card" href="/tools/build-calculator/">
            <span class="hm-more-icon">{% include "icons/calculator.svg" %}</span>
            <span class="hm-more-title">Build cost calculator</span>
            <span class="hm-more-text">Price out a restoration before you commit. No account needed.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="hm-more-card" href="/resources/">
            <span class="hm-more-icon">{% include "icons/book.svg" %}</span>
            <span class="hm-more-title">Buyer's guides</span>
            <span class="hm-more-text">Which version to buy, a printable inspection checklist, red flags, and what a fair price looks like. One for every car.</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Newsletter -->
<section class="hm-newsletter" id="newsletter" aria-labelledby="hm-news-title">
    <div>
        <h2 id="hm-news-title">New guides by email.</h2>
        <p>When a new car or a new guide goes up, I'll send a short note. That's it.</p>
    </div>
    <form class="hm-news-form" data-newsletter-form>
        <label for="newsletter-email">Email address</label>
        <div class="hm-news-row">
